# Framework Tier Migration Guide

Khaira projects can be upgraded across architectural tiers at any time.

## Available Tiers

1. **Simple**: Compact single-file definitions, pure FastAPI.
2. **Standard** (Default): 5-layer pipeline, `KhairaApp` / `KairaApp`, auto-registration, security & monitoring providers.
3. **Enterprise**: Domain-driven grouping (`domains/`), OpenTelemetry distributed tracing, Dependency Injection container.

## Upgrading Tiers

To upgrade safely with snapshot rollback:
```bash
# Preview changes
khaira upgrade --tier enterprise --dry-run

# Apply upgrade
khaira upgrade --tier enterprise
```

## Microservice Decomposition
To decompose models into an independent service:
```bash
khaira microservice split --service user-service --models User Profile
```
